The verification plugin adapts text from pstack, by Lauren Tan, at
https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/bf0c7cd80a/pstack (version 0.15.42),
which is distributed under the MIT License below.

- skills/create/SKILL.md and references/verify-skill.md adapt
  pstack/skills/create-verification-skill/SKILL.md.
- skills/maintain/SKILL.md and agents/feature-reader.md adapt
  pstack/skills/maintain-verification-skill/SKILL.md.
- The feature map contract in references/verify-skill.md and the shape of
  references/feature-map-example/ adapt
  pstack/skills/create-verification-skill/references/feature-map-example/.

The drive recipes, the Atlas example and the Claude Code specifics are new.

